            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\n\nYes, I've thought about it. At least for `builtin_opts.word_start` it is a good idea. Maybe also via a new `gen_vimpattern_spooter()`. Initially it didn't happen due to performance issues and not quite stable `vim.regex()` capabilities. But now it should be a different situation. I'll take a look.",
