        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "The `builtin_opts.word_start` now uses Neovim's notion of the keyword. This is powered by the new `gen_spotter.vimpattern` (after a breaking introduction of the `gen_spotter` table instead of separate `gen_xxx_spotter()` functions).\n\nThanks again for reminding me of this! As there are planned some other breaking changes in 'mini.jump2d' in this release, it is a good time to also introduce the `word_start` change.",
